escription"><p>You are given a string containing digits from 2 to 9 inclusi=
ve. Each digit maps to a set of letters as on a traditional phone keypad:</=
p><div class=3D"mdx-table-wrap"><table><tbody><tr><td><b>1</b><span class=
=3D"empty-node"></span></td><td><p><b>2</b> abc</p></td><td><p><b>3</b> def=
</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>4</b> ghi</p></td><td><p><b>5</b> jkl</p></td><=
